' ============================================================
'  DSH remote access - logon autostart launcher (template)
'  Generated by scripts\install.ps1 into the current user's
'  Startup folder as DSH-Web-Remote.vbs.
'  __WATCHDOG_PATH__ is replaced with the absolute watchdog.ps1 path.
